Output ../src/assets/recordings/cli-tool-call.webp

Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1100
Set Height 600
Set Padding 16
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "mcp-tui --cmd npx --args '@modelcontextprotocol/server-everything,stdio' tool call echo message='hello mcp'"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 5s
